as del Mar Caribe al Norte, la corriente del Océano Pacífico, así como las cordilleras que lo atraviesan por el centro de norte a sur.</h3></div><div class=\"col2\"><div class=\"global-picture\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://www.infobae.com/resizer/v2/A4CTAZD3GFDMJNQ4NSZYVNJDMI.jpg?auth=14611cb258083455447aff3018211c7b74524d67abb1c532ffdc44e73902891c&amp;smart=true&amp;width=400&amp;height=225&amp;quality=85\" media=\"(min-width: 1200px)\"></source><source srcset=\"https://www.infobae.com/resizer/v2/A4CTAZD3GFDMJNQ4NSZYVNJDMI.jpg?auth=14611cb258083455447aff3018211c7b74524d67abb1c532ffdc44e73902891c&amp;smart=true&amp;width=420&amp;height=236&amp;quality=85\" media=\"(min-width: 350px)\"></source><source srcset=\"https://www.infobae.com/resizer/v2/A4CTAZD3GFDMJNQ4NSZYVNJDMI.jpg?auth=14611cb258083455447aff3018211c7b74524d67abb1c532ffdc44e73902891c&amp;smart=true&amp;width=350&amp;height=197&amp;quality=85\" media=\"(min-width: 80px)\"></source><img alt=\"Conoce el clima de este\" class=\"global-image feed-list-image feed-list-image-first\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"low\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.infobae.com/resizer/v2/A4CTAZD3GFDMJNQ4NSZYVNJDMI.jpg?auth=14611cb258083455447aff3018211c7b74524d67abb1c532ffdc44e73902891c&amp;smart=true&amp;width=350&amp;height=197&amp;quality=85\" width=\"16\"></picture></div></div></a><div id=\"fusion-static-exit:5EDF7JHVDVH4LIID5LVYCIISEQ-feed-list-story\" style=\"display:none\" data-fusion-component=\"5EDF7JHVDVH4LIID5LVYCIISEQ-feed-list-story\"></div><div id=\"fusion-static-enter:LX3N4ZLNVJGNBM6AZEAXJXHWOA-feed-list-story\" style=\"display:none\" data-fusion-component=\"LX3N4ZLNVJGNBM6AZEAXJXHWOA-feed-list-story\"></div><a class=\"feed-list-card\" href=\"/colombia/2025/07/24/clima-en-barranquilla-conoce-el-pronostico-y-preparate-antes-de-salir/\"><div class=\"col1\"><h2 class=\"feed-list-card-headline-lean\">Clima en Barranquilla: conoce el pronóstico y prepárate antes de salir</h2><h3 class=\"deck\